    {
      "id": "r3",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. CXI.—लालाायते see Siddh. Kaum. II., 223 ओज शब्दो वृत्तिविषये",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "तद्वति. I owe this explanation to Mr. Râjârâm S'âstrî.—S'ârdû-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "lavikrîiḍta.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. CXII.—The adjectives in the first three lines go both",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "with नरः and नटः. संसारान्ते i. e. at the end of this life. जवनिका=",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "curtain. विशति with जवनिका must be taken as equivalent to ‘goes",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "behind.’—S'ikhariṇî.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. CXIII.—स्त्रैण = collection of women. See Siddh. Kaum.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "I., 491 and comp. Uttararâmacharita p. 114. यान्तु perhaps is a",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "better reading than यान्ति.—S'ikhariṇî.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r6",
      "type": "heading",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "MISCELLANEOUS STANZAS.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r7",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. I.— अकिंचन = indigent comp. Kumâra. V., 77. समचेतसः see",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "St. 84 supra. सुखमया is not grammatically correct सुखमय्यः, which is,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "breaks the metre.—Anushṭub.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r8",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "St. II.—On the last two lines Râmarshi says “वा अथवा कियद्व-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "क्ष्यामः अत्र वर्तमानार्थे भविष्यत्प्रयोगः कियद्वदामः बतेति खेदे त्वया आत्मनि स्वस्मिन् किमिव",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "किमु न अपकृतं कः अपकारः न कृतः कथं यावत्साकल्येन तावत्प्रथमं त्वया पुनरपि भूयोपि",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "तदेव आत्मनि अपकृतमेव व्यवसितं कर्तुमारब्धम्. R. also supplies हे हृदय at the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "beginning. It will be observed that यावत् and तावत् in R.’s ex-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "planation are not taken as correlatives. I think the translation",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "should be thus : “ Alas ! what self-injury is there having done",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "which to yourself you have not immediately worked at the same",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "again !”—S'ikhariṇî.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r9",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. III.—ग्राम = collection. अम्भोजचन्द्रिका comp. Prasannarâ-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "ghava p. 159. विडम्बनम् = mockery. Nothing noble can withstand",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "the claims of the stomach!—Hâriṇî.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r10",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. IV.—Râmarshi supplies a चेत् with the first three lines,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "unnecessarily.—Anushṭub.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    }
  ],
